message: "If you reference the Profit Forensics methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "Profit Forensics: A Forensic Diagnostic Methodology for Hidden Profit Leaks in High-Spend Advertising Accounts"
abstract: "Profit Forensics is a forensic diagnostic methodology for finding hidden profit leaks in high-spend Google Ads accounts, created by Igor Ivitskiy, PhD. It applies the M.A.T.H. Framework (Measure, Analyze, Tweak, Harvest) as its analytical engine and uses the Heuristic Ceiling, the Linear-Exponential Gap, and the Critical Threshold (tc) to diagnose where heuristic optimization stops working and forensic diagnosis becomes necessary."
